      "description": {
        "en": "Advances the action of one designated ally character (excluding Robin • Summeretto) by #1[i]% and regenerates a fixed amount of Energy equal to #3[f1]% of their Max Energy. Then, grants them the \"Special Guest\" effect. When the \"Special Guest\" character or their summon attacks, they additionally grant Robin • Summeretto #2[i] Vibes but cannot make other friendly targets gain the action advance effect. This lasts for 2 turn(s), and its duration decreases by 1 at the start of this character's turn.",
        "zh-CN": "使除知更鸟•晴歌外的指定我方单体角色行动提前#1[i]%并固定恢复等同于#3[f1]%能量上限的能量。随后使其获得【特邀嘉宾】效果，持有【特邀嘉宾】的角色及其召唤物攻击时额外使知更鸟•晴歌获得#2[i]点气氛值，且无法使其他友方目标获得行动提前效果，持续2回合。该角色每回合开始时持续回合数减1。"
