    {
      "id": 151204,
      "type": "Talent",
      "name": { "en": "Wings Heed No Borders", "zh-CN": "巡游在无界的天空" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Memosprite \"Summer Songbirds\" has an initial Max HP equal to #1[i]% of Robin • Summeretto's Max HP and an initial SPD equal to #2[i]% of Robin • Summeretto's SPD. When an ally target uses an attack, or when they provide healing or Shield for the first time in any target's turn, Robin • Summeretto gains Vibes by 1 point, capped at #5[i]. While \"Summer Songbirds\" Bessie is on the field, if Robin • Summeretto's Vibes is #6[i] or higher, immediately summons \"Summer Songbirds\" Drummie, and if Vibes is #7[i] or higher, immediately summons \"Summer Songbirds\" Paddie. When all \"Summer Songbirds\" take the stage, dispels all Crowd Control debuffs inflicted upon Robin • Summeretto and the \"Summer Songbirds\", starts the \"Fever\" state, and deploys a Zone. When ally targets deal DMG within the Zone, they ignore a percentage of enemy targets' DEF equal to (#8[f1]% + Vibes × #9[f1]%).\nWhile in the \"Fever\" state, Robin • Summeretto and the \"Summer Songbirds\" are immune to Crowd Control debuffs. Robin • Summeretto will not enter her turn until the \"Fever\" state ends.",
        "zh-CN": "忆灵「晴空乐手」初始拥有等同于知更鸟•晴歌#1[i]%生命上限的生命上限和等同于知更鸟•晴歌#2[i]%速度的速度。我方目标施放攻击时，或在任意目标回合第一次提供治疗效果或护盾时，知更鸟•晴歌获得1点气氛值，上限#5[i]点。「晴空乐手」贝茜在场时，若知更鸟•晴歌的气氛值大于等于#6[i]点，立即召唤「晴空乐手」啾米，若气氛值大于等于#7[i]点，立即召唤「晴空乐手」派丁。当「晴空乐手」全员登台后，解除知更鸟•晴歌与「晴空乐手」陷入的所有控制类负面状态、进入【Fever】状态并展开结界，结界内我方目标造成伤害时无视敌方目标（#8[f1]%+气氛值*#9[f1]%）防御力。\n处于【Fever】状态时，知更鸟•晴歌与「晴空乐手」免疫控制类负面状态，【Fever】状态结束前知更鸟•晴歌不会进入自己的回合。"
      },
