      "icon": "icon/skill/1512_talent.png",
      "maxLevel": 15,
      "summary": {
        "en": "When an ally target uses an attack, or provides healing or Shield, Robin • Summeretto gains Vibes. Once Vibes reaches a certain value, summons \"Summer Songbirds\" Drummie and \"Summer Songbirds\" Paddie respectively. After all \"Summer Songbirds\" take the stage, Robin • Summeretto and the \"Summer Songbirds\" enter the \"Fever\" state and deploy a Zone. When ally targets deal DMG inside the Zone, they ignore a portion of enemy targets' DEF.\nWhile in the \"Fever\" state, Robin • Summeretto and the \"Summer Songbirds\" are immune to Crowd Control debuffs. Robin • Summeretto will not enter her turn until the \"Fever\" state ends.",
        "zh-CN": "我方目标施放攻击时、提供治疗效果或护盾时，知更鸟•晴歌获得气氛值。气氛值到达一定点数后，分别召唤「晴空乐手」啾米与「晴空乐手」派丁。当「晴空乐手」全员登台后，知更鸟•晴歌与「晴空乐手」进入【Fever】状态并展开结界，结界内我方目标造成伤害时无视敌方目标部分防御力。\n处于【Fever】状态时，知更鸟•晴歌与「晴空乐手」免疫控制类负面状态，【Fever】状态结束前知更鸟•晴歌不会进入自己的回合。"
