      "name": { "en": "A Warble of Wings", "zh-CN": "扑翅雀跃的和声" },
      "description": {
        "en": "While in the \"Fever\" state, the \"Summer Songbirds\" and a countdown will appear on the Action Order. And the DMG dealt by Robin • Summeretto and \"Summer Songbirds\" increases by an amount equal to (#1[i]% + Vibes × #2[f1]%). When \"Summer Songbirds'\" turn starts, uses the Memosprite Skill. The countdown has an initial SPD of #9[i]. And when its turn starts, deducts #10[i]% of the current Vibes (minimum #6[i] points). When the Vibes reaches 0, the \"Summer Songbirds\" disappears and Robin • Summeretto exits the \"Fever\" state. While the \"Summer Songbirds\" is on the field, based on the number of its members present, increases the DMG taken by all enemies by #3[f1]%/#4[f1]%/#5[f1]% respectively.",
        "zh-CN": "处于【Fever】状态时，「晴空乐手」和倒计时将出现在行动序列上，并使知更鸟•晴歌与自身造成的伤害提高（#1[i]%+气氛值*#2[f1]%）。「晴空乐手」回合开始时施放忆灵技。倒计时初始速度#9[i]点，回合开始时扣除#10[i]%的当前气氛值，至少扣除#6[i]点，当气氛值为零时，「晴空乐手」消失并使知更鸟•晴歌退出【Fever】状态。「晴空乐手」在场时，根据成员数量使敌方全体受到的伤害分别提高#3[f1]%/#4[f1]%/#5[f1]%。"
      },
