        "en": "\"Summer Songbirds\" will keep a tally of 100% of the non-True DMG dealt by ally targets. When using the Memosprite Skill, additionally deals True DMG to the enemy target with the highest HP, equal to (11% + current Vibes × 0.1%) of the total tally. Then, clears 50% of the tally.",
        "zh-CN": "「晴空乐手」会记录我方目标造成的非真实伤害的100%，施放忆灵技时对生命值最高的敌方目标额外造成记录伤害总额（11%+当前气氛值点数*0.1%）的真实伤害，随后清空记录值的50%。"
