      "description": {
        "en": "Increases the Memosprite Skill's DMG multiplier by 100% of its original value. While in the \"Fever\" state, Robin • Summeretto can store her Ultimate up to 2 times. After entering the \"Fever\" state for the first time in this battle or when the \"Fever\" countdown's turn starts, regenerates a fixed 140 Energy.",
        "zh-CN": "忆灵技的伤害倍率提高原倍率的100%。处于【Fever】状态时，知更鸟•晴歌的终结技可以最多储存2次，本场战斗中第一次进入【Fever】状态后或【Fever】倒计时回合开始时，固定恢复140点能量。"
      },
