      "id": 1512101,
      "anchor": "Point06",
      "name": { "en": "Deviated Chords", "zh-CN": "偏离和弦" },
      "description": {
        "en": "When an ally target causes Robin • Summeretto to gain Vibes, if their ATK is higher than Robin • Summeretto's, increases that target's ATK by an amount equal to (#1[i]% + Vibes × #2[f1]%) of Robin • Summeretto's Max HP. Otherwise, increases that target's CRIT DMG by an amount equal to (#3[i]% + Vibes × #4[f1]%). Lasts for #5[i] turn(s).",
        "zh-CN": "我方目标使知更鸟•晴歌获得气氛值时，若攻击力大于知更鸟•晴歌，则使该目标的攻击力提高等同于知更鸟•晴歌的生命上限的(#1[i]%+气氛值*#2[f1]%)，否则使该目标的暴击伤害提高（#3[i]%+气氛值*#4[f1]%），持续#5[i]回合。"
      },
