      "description": {
        "en": "When Robin • Summeretto or the \"Summer Songbirds\" receive healing or Shield provided by teammates, causes Robin • Summeretto to gain #1[i] stack(s) of \"Groove,\" capped at #3[i]. The first time Robin • Summeretto gains Vibes during any target's turn, if she has \"Groove,\" consumes 1 stack of \"Groove\" and regenerates a fixed #2[i] Energy.",
        "zh-CN": "知更鸟•晴歌或「晴空乐手」受到队友提供的治疗效果或护盾时，使知更鸟•晴歌获得#1[i]层【律动】，上限#3[i]层。知更鸟•晴歌在任意目标回合内第一次获得气氛值时若持有【律动】，则消耗1层【律动】并固定恢复#2[i]点能量。"
